### Requirements

## home-page
1. change the header logo to a cross beside the app name: <logo><Mapple>

2. add a searchbar at the top to search habits

3. On the right side add 3 buttons:
- reorder Results
- create habit
- habitlist

4. Add user button with the user name on the right corner

5. add more lateral padding(5-10) in the main body 

6. Add 'log today ->' button when expanding habit card

7. Additional info on binary habit card expanded:
- current streak
- total entries. i.e: 10 days
- average
- Longest streak

8. Additional info on amount habit card expanded:
- Today. i.e: $10.00
- Total. i.e: $3,231,000.000


